The '''Rebel Camp''' is a camp of former men of [[Colonel Kurzen]], who managed to escape the madness that befell the Colonel and most of his followers. The camp is situated in the northernmost part of [[Stranglethorn Vale]], just west of the road leading south from [[Duskwood]] and northwest of [[Kurzen's Compound]]. The soldiers here have their task set: To overthrow their former master, Kurzen.

